    "kind": "QEMU stop runstate semantics, not a final-drain race",
    "sequence": "WATCHDOG reset -> guest-reset SHUTDOWN -> STOP -> stop ACK -> query-status shutdown/running=false -> runner exception before quit -> SIGTERM -> host-signal SHUTDOWN; QEMU handled the signal and returned 0.",
    "primary_code": [
