      "include/system/runstate.h:runstate_is_live",
      "qapi/run-state.json:RunState.shutdown and SHUTDOWN event"
    ],
    "explanation": "The stop command invokes vm_stop(PAUSED), but do_vm_stop changes state only when the old state is live; shutdown remains shutdown under -no-shutdown."
